    "把录音文件里说的话转成文字。默认只在本机识别，录音不上传" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turns what is said in a recording into text. On the device by default; the recording is not uploaded"
